  "_approach": "Kick-dropout 'ratatat' build: bar 1 is the warehouse stomp at full weight; bar 2 pulls the kick completely and the snare fires a military-style 16th roll with rests, ramping to a 127 hit on beat 4 (step 12) followed by three empty 16ths - the gap that makes the returning kick+bass slam. Open hats hold every offbeat until the gap. Ref: Holy Goof, Skepsis, Bru-C era drop-ins. (re-voiced for the Vermona DRM1 MKIII's 8 channels)",
